\subsection{Graveyards}
If you have a character with a bad AC, you'd better pray  
that you don't run into one of these.  Graveyards are rooms filled     
with nasty undead creatures - wraiths and vampires that will drain     
your levels away, and zombies and skeletons and ghosts.  (Note that    
ghosts in a graveyard are randomly generated, although they may take   
names from the high score file.  Thus, they won't leave ghost          
stacks.)  If you have a character with a good AC, these can be quite
a boost:  Kill off all the wraiths and eat the corpses to go up many levels!
