\subsection{Throne Rooms}
A throne room is a room filled with monsters.  The      
major difference between this room and David's Treasure Zoo is that    
throne rooms have a throne in them.  Sitting on this throne can        
produce all sort of interesting effects, and gold can be gotten (if    
you're lucky) by kicking the throne.  See the $Throne Effects$ and       
$Kicking$ sections for more information about thrones.                   
